[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おーい、樹里\r\nそろそろ出番だぞ――って、あれ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00009",
    "bgm": "008"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（いないな、どこいったんだ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00008",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……そろそろ出番だし、\r\nもしかして早めに待機してるかもしれないな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050010,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "…………",
    "charCategory": "stand_costume",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "011",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（お、いたいた\r\nん、真剣な顔してなに見てるんだ）",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ワン、ツ－\r\nタ－ンの後タメてから、ポ－ズっと",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050030,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "あいつの間の取り方、綺麗に見えるな……\r\nあれならすぐにでも――",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "探したぞ、樹里",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "うわっ！　……って、なんだアンタか\r\nいきなり話しかけんなよ、ビックリするだろ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おっと、すまん。それに邪魔して悪かったな\r\n他のアイドルのステ－ジを研究してたんだろ？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "研究ってほどじゃね－よ\r\nただ、盗めるもんは盗んどきたいって思ってな",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど\r\nそれで、成果はあったか？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ま－な\r\nすぐに実践できそうなもんがあったよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、樹里は頼もしくなったな\r\nアイドルとして成長してくれて、本当に嬉しいよ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さ、そろそろ出番だ\r\n思う存分――ん？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……あん？　どうした",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "緊張してるのか？\r\n指先、震えてるぞ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……アンタ、ホントよく見てんな",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "こんな大きなステージだし、\r\nお客さんがいっぱい見にきてんだ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そりゃ、いつもよりドキドキすんに決まってんだろ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050100"
  },
  {
    "select": "お客さんは味方だ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "大きな舞台に\r\n立ちたかったんじゃ\r\nないのか",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "いつもみたいに\r\n自信を持て",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "text": "★選択肢①【お客さんは味方だ】",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お客さんは味方だ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "blank",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050110,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "味方……ね\r\nまあ、敵じゃないってのは、わかるけどよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほら、目を閉じて耳を澄ませてみろ",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050120,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ん、こんな騒がしいところで……？　\r\n精神統一ってやつか？　\r\nまぁ、アンタがそういうなら、やってみるけどよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうだ\r\nステ－ジの向こうから一筋の声が聞こえてこないか",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0111"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050130,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "…………\r\n……へへ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0111",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050140,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "聞こえたぜ……\r\nアタシの名前を呼ぶ、ファンの声が",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0111",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050150,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "なあプロデュ－サ－、\r\nアタシ……思い出したよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0111",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050160,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "バスケの試合中さ、\r\n客席の声援に元気づけられてたんだよな",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0111",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050170,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "バスケやめて、ずっと忘れてた\r\n応援してくれる人がいたから、勝てた試合もあったってな",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0111",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050180,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシがアイドル始めたのには色々理由があるけど、\r\nこの声援が聞きて－ってのもあったんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0111",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その願い、叶ったか？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0111"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050190,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ああ、ファンのために、応援してくれる人のために、\r\nアタシはステージに全力で立てる",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0111",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050200,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "じゃあ行ってくるぜ、プロデュ－サ－！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "se": "0111",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050200"
  },
  {
    "text": "★選択肢②【大きな舞台に立ちたかったんじゃないのか】",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大きな舞台に立ちたかったんじゃないのか？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050210,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ったく、どれだけ良く見てんだよ\r\nいつから気付いてたんだ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつからだっけな\r\n普段のレッスンやステ－ジを見ているうちにな",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050220,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そっか……実はさ、アンタにスカウトされる前は、\r\n心にぽっかり穴が開いてるみて－だったんだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050230,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "何をしてもさ、物足んね－し、満たされね－\r\nつまんね－し、わらえね－……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050240,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ずっと、探してたんだろうな\r\nバスケをしてた頃よりも、大きなところへ続く道を",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今、樹里がいる新しい道はどうだ？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050250,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アンタが連れてきたんだ、聞くまでもね－だろ\r\n……まぁ、想像以上だったよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050260,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシ、マジでアイドルとしての道を突っ走ってるよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、今の樹里は光り輝いてる",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050270,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "へへ\r\nまだまだだけどな……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050280,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "心の穴は満たされてきたはずなのに、物足りね－んだ\r\nもっと、高いところに行きたくなる",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050290,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "んでよ、いつまでたってもゴ－ルが見えね－のが\r\nおもしれ－ところだよな",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ふふ、緊張が解けてきたみたいだな",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0111"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050300,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ホントだ、震えが止まってる",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0111",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050310,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アンタ、本当にやり手のプロデュ－サ－だな\r\nじゃ、ステ－ジ行ってくるぜ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "se": "0111",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050310"
  },
  {
    "text": "★選択肢③【いつもみたいに自信を持て】",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつもみたいに自信を持て",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050320,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そうだな、\r\nいつもみたいに派手に踊ってみせてやる",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050320"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050330,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "今からステ－ジに立つのが楽しみだ\r\n武者震いが止まらね－よ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "震えてるのは武者震いなのか？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050340,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ったりめ－だろ？\r\n緊張してるからとかじゃね－し",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050340"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか……？",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050350,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "へへ\r\nよけいな心配、するんじゃね－よ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100105/1011001050350"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011001050360,
    "speaker": "樹里",
